SUMMARY:📄 File LA Articles of Organization (target)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260515
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260516
DESCRIPTION:Target date to file Articles of Organization with LA Secretary of State, leaving a week of buffer before the May 22 name reservation expiry.\n\nNote: per Research_Gaps_Filled.md, the structurally correct move for QSBS §1202 is filing as a C-corp (DE or LA) and issuing Series Seed preferred — NOT LLC member units. Confirm structure before filing.\n\nFile here: https://geauxbiz.sos.la.gov/
URL:https://geauxbiz.sos.la.gov/
CATEGORIES:LLC,QSBS
PRIORITY:1
