UID:mcc-sam-gov-registration-begin@calendar-feeds.philipinosis.github
SUMMARY:📋 Begin SAM.gov registration (4–6 week processing)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260515
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260516
DESCRIPTION:Begin SAM.gov registration the same day EIN is received. Processing takes 4–6 weeks, which means the USDA LFPP June 5 deadline is likely unreachable without an existing SAM registration. Required for all federal grant applications.\n\nRegister: https://sam.gov/\nThen Grants.gov: https://www.grants.gov/web/grants/applicants/registration.html
URL:https://sam.gov/
CATEGORIES:LLC,GRANTS
PRIORITY:2
END:VEVENT
