UID:mcc-usda-lfpp-fy2026@calendar-feeds.philipinosis.github
SUMMARY:💰 USDA LFPP FY2026 deadline ($500K ceiling)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260605
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260606
DESCRIPTION:USDA AMS Local Food Promotion Program FY2026.\n\nCeiling: $500K implementation / $100K planning. Match: 25% cash. Fit: ★★★★ — Aquaculture-eligible; processing intermediary frame; strongest near-term competitive opportunity.\n\nContact: FMLFPPgrants@usda.gov\n\nProgram: https://www.ams.usda.gov/services/grants/lfpp\n\nNOTE: SAM.gov + Grants.gov registration must be active. Without an existing registration, this deadline is likely unreachable.
URL:https://www.ams.usda.gov/services/grants/lfpp
CATEGORIES:GRANTS,USDA
PRIORITY:2
